WEBVTT

00:01.040 --> 00:04.270
<i>Is she absorbing the power from my heart?</i>

00:05.000 --> 00:08.440
On a cold, cold winter's night...

00:08.880 --> 00:11.400
Pesha's tiny hand...

00:12.080 --> 00:15.860
The candle that just wouldn't 
light on shivering nights...

00:15.860 --> 00:18.650
The moon that looked down 
upon us from the night sky...

00:19.290 --> 00:22.000
The lake that seemed like an abyss...

00:22.620 --> 00:28.000
Hey, why? Why did everyone lie to me?

00:28.300 --> 00:30.920
I believed in all of you.

00:32.210 --> 00:34.880
But the outside world is just so...

00:35.980 --> 00:38.050
full of shit!

02:10.600 --> 02:16.440
<b><u>Episode 10
</u>The Lonely Ice 
and Small Flame</b>

02:13.170 --> 02:16.180
<i>The few years I had after 
leaving the orphanage</i>

02:16.180 --> 02:21.330
<i>were more than enough to learn 
just how cold the outside world was.</i>

02:22.590 --> 02:23.990
Please take one.

02:24.410 --> 02:26.350
How about one for your little one?

02:26.350 --> 02:27.750
It'll make them happy.

02:28.240 --> 02:31.250
Please take one. Please.

02:52.080 --> 02:53.190
I'm...

02:54.340 --> 02:56.190
going to have to find more work.

02:59.180 --> 03:00.300
It's so cold.

03:13.390 --> 03:15.250
What's the matter, Pesha?

03:15.800 --> 03:17.330
Are you hungry?

03:20.120 --> 03:22.650
Right. I'm sorry.

03:24.090 --> 03:26.040
I'll make you something.

03:26.040 --> 03:27.300
Wait a moment, okay?

03:34.210 --> 03:37.150
<i>Pesha is my one and only light.</i>

03:38.460 --> 03:44.140
<i>I won't let you feel hungry or sad...</i>

03:52.770 --> 03:55.380
Letana-san. Do you have a moment?

03:57.630 --> 04:01.170
I'm sorry, but could you quit 
at the end of the month?

04:01.170 --> 04:02.290
Huh?

04:02.290 --> 04:04.850
You know... We're in a recession right now.

04:04.850 --> 04:07.400
We're struggling with job cuts.

04:10.680 --> 04:13.340
I see... I understand.

04:16.600 --> 04:19.620
<i>I'm going to need to find my next job...</i>

04:23.260 --> 04:25.450
Pesha, my dear...

04:25.870 --> 04:27.800
You can't fall asleep here.

04:33.030 --> 04:35.950
<i>Pesha and I are both... smiling?</i>

04:36.910 --> 04:39.040
<i>And a cake?</i>

04:40.990 --> 04:44.470
<i>Have I ever even made a face like this?</i>

04:46.660 --> 04:48.720
I'm so sorry, Pesha,

04:48.720 --> 04:52.470
that I can't let you eat 
all this wonderful food.

04:53.550 --> 04:56.990
But someday... Someday I will...

05:06.760 --> 05:09.960
<i>I can't cut down our food budget any further.</i>

05:09.960 --> 05:13.250
<i>I need to find more work 
quickly, or Pesha will...</i>

05:18.060 --> 05:19.740
Yes? Can I help you?

05:18.920 --> 05:21.170
Damn it, Letana-san!

05:21.170 --> 05:22.920
You know why I'm here!

05:22.920 --> 05:26.220
Your rent! You're already six months behind!

05:28.480 --> 05:32.430
I'm so sorry... I'm having a 
really hard time finding work.

05:33.010 --> 05:35.280
Things are hard for me, too.

05:35.280 --> 05:38.170
I'm no monster, so I hate to say this...

05:38.170 --> 05:41.440
But if this continues, I'm going 
to have to ask you to leave.

05:43.480 --> 05:46.930
I'm sorry. I just need a little more time...

05:59.570 --> 06:01.710
What's the matter, Pesha?

06:02.080 --> 06:03.210
You're not going to eat?

06:06.460 --> 06:08.630
You can't be a picky eater.

06:08.630 --> 06:10.470
You need to eat everything you can.

06:14.200 --> 06:17.000
Come on, Pesha. I know you understand.

06:17.890 --> 06:19.940
Please, just eat. Be a good girl.

06:20.470 --> 06:24.230
Come on. Please... Pesha.

06:25.390 --> 06:26.740
That's enough!

06:31.240 --> 06:35.290
Pesha, no... I-I was just...

06:35.800 --> 06:36.750
Ma...

06:37.290 --> 06:42.380
Mama... You... h-haven't 
eaten anything in so long...

06:43.830 --> 06:49.890
I just wanted to tell you... 
th-that you should eat my share...

06:49.890 --> 06:51.890
I'm sorry...

06:52.200 --> 06:53.630
I'm sorry...

06:55.560 --> 06:57.590
I'm sorry...

06:57.590 --> 06:58.680
<i>I can't.</i>

07:00.020 --> 07:04.250
<i>I can't be this child's mother.</i>

07:04.980 --> 07:09.400
<i>Because of me, she'll never be happy.</i>

07:11.010 --> 07:14.860
<i>If I were to just disappear...</i>

07:22.530 --> 07:24.920
<i>If I just disappeared...</i>

07:28.200 --> 07:33.850
<i>I wonder if Pesha would also be able 
to go to that orphanage and be happy...</i>

07:34.560 --> 07:37.150
<i>I wish I could go back to those days.</i>

07:37.150 --> 07:40.230
<i>To that warm... happy place.</i>

07:42.510 --> 07:46.900
<i>I can't bear these cold winter nights anymore.</i>

07:48.710 --> 07:49.900
<i>Since this is the end...</i>

07:50.550 --> 07:54.660
<i>I want to let her have some 
delicious cake, just this once.</i>

07:58.280 --> 08:00.120
Oh, welcome.

08:01.190 --> 08:03.170
What kind of cake are you looking for?

08:04.470 --> 08:10.300
Um... I was thinking about getting 
a delicious cake for my daughter...

08:11.410 --> 08:14.930
But I'll actually just take 
one of these cookies...

08:15.180 --> 08:18.190
Oh, dear. Just a moment.

08:19.150 --> 08:21.930
Here you go. This is the 
cake that I recommend.

08:22.280 --> 08:24.380
It's very delicious.

08:24.380 --> 08:27.980
Huh? But... I can't afford this.

08:27.980 --> 08:29.570
This is so extravagant.

08:29.980 --> 08:33.570
Oh, it's fine. Please take it.

08:33.570 --> 08:34.290
Huh?

08:34.800 --> 08:38.080
But in return, once you eat it, please come 
back to tell me if you liked it or not.

08:38.570 --> 08:40.960
And when you do, bring 
your daughter with you.

08:43.170 --> 08:45.830
Thank you... truly.

08:46.690 --> 08:48.840
I promise... I'll come back again.

08:57.650 --> 08:58.490
<i>I can't...</i>

08:59.880 --> 09:03.600
<i>I can't give up yet... 
For Pesha's sake, as well.</i>

09:04.890 --> 09:08.480
<i>I need to apologize for yelling at her.</i>

09:09.220 --> 09:12.300
<i>I wonder if Pesha hates me now.</i>

09:13.060 --> 09:14.720
<i>I need to tell her...</i>

09:26.030 --> 09:30.310
<i>that even so, I'm wishing for her happiness.</i>

09:32.690 --> 09:39.340
<i>Come to think of it... I've never 
properly told her how I felt.</i>

09:45.100 --> 09:48.550
You had the nerve to buy 
cake? You rich bitch.

09:57.380 --> 10:02.230
<i>The world... took everything away from me...</i>

10:02.840 --> 10:05.000
<i>But that's fine.</i>

10:06.690 --> 10:09.410
<i>Even if I go to hell...</i>

10:15.810 --> 10:16.840
<i>Pesha.</i>

10:17.360 --> 10:21.930
<i>May you and so many children like you</i>

10:21.930 --> 10:25.660
<i>never know about this world 
that's so filled with pain.</i>

10:26.430 --> 10:28.950
<i>To ensure that happens,</i>

10:28.950 --> 10:32.040
<i>I'd even become a demon 
and destroy this world...</i>

10:33.460 --> 10:34.390
<i>Oh...</i>

10:35.930 --> 10:37.530
<i>It's so cold.</i>

10:41.330 --> 10:42.110
Ma...

10:43.730 --> 10:44.830
Mama...

10:45.550 --> 10:47.450
Say, Pesha...

10:47.720 --> 10:51.880
I'll protect all of you from this hell.

10:53.080 --> 10:54.380
Pepesha-san!

10:55.420 --> 10:59.980
<i>What I just saw... Was that... 
Pepesha-san's mom's memories?</i>

10:59.980 --> 11:02.500
Did you see that, too, you pain in the butt?

11:02.500 --> 11:06.140
Tzveta-chan's unfortunate memories 
that you can't even laugh at?

11:06.140 --> 11:08.020
And now, quiz time!

11:08.290 --> 11:09.270
Here!

11:10.390 --> 11:12.310
<b>Pain in the Butt</b>

11:10.390 --> 11:14.320
Will the heroes be able to 
make Tzveta-chan smile?

11:18.070 --> 11:20.100
Welp, too bad! You're out of time!

11:20.100 --> 11:22.380
You can explody now!

11:22.200 --> 11:23.160
<b>Pain in the Butt</b>

11:23.470 --> 11:24.990
I-I should've expected that!

11:28.980 --> 11:32.480
Are you... really Mama? Really?

11:32.480 --> 11:35.910
Yes. The Mama you hate.

11:36.500 --> 11:39.930
You loathed me, didn't you?

11:39.930 --> 11:43.010
Because I couldn't make you happy.

11:43.560 --> 11:47.220
<i>Why... Why would you say that?</i>

11:47.220 --> 11:48.770
But that's fine.

11:49.070 --> 11:51.540
Even if my flesh goes up in flames,

11:51.540 --> 11:54.270
I just wish for your happiness...

11:54.920 --> 11:57.520
<i>She's wrong. I have to tell her.</i>

11:58.040 --> 12:01.030
I'll even embrace all the 
hatred in this world...

12:01.030 --> 12:03.530
<i>I have to tell her. I...</i>

12:04.140 --> 12:06.320
...and sing a lullaby.

12:08.410 --> 12:09.780
Mama—

12:15.990 --> 12:19.390
<i>I can't... My heart is already...</i>

12:19.860 --> 12:23.590
Pesha. You don't need to suffer anymore.

12:24.150 --> 12:26.810
Suffering doesn't belong here.

12:27.670 --> 12:31.540
This place is what created 
you as you are right now.

12:31.540 --> 12:34.160
The you that I ruined.

12:34.890 --> 12:37.950
Come now, Pesha. Don't cry.

12:37.950 --> 12:39.980
I'm truly happy...

12:41.570 --> 12:46.650
to see that you've become 
so happy without me.

12:49.910 --> 12:50.790
You're wrong!

12:58.710 --> 13:00.550
<b>Pain in the Butt</b>

13:01.530 --> 13:03.220
Huh? Where'd ya go?

13:04.420 --> 13:06.970
You're forgetting something very important!

13:07.330 --> 13:11.720
You have no idea just how precious 
you are to Pepesha-san!

13:12.380 --> 13:17.520
The kindness you showed her... 
continues to live in Spirit's heart!

13:18.670 --> 13:24.740
<i>That's when I remembered a small 
flame from a candle I'd seen once.</i>

13:26.610 --> 13:30.550
<i>The flame stood no chance 
against the cold that day,</i>

13:30.550 --> 13:32.820
<i>so it was tiny and flickering...</i>

13:34.170 --> 13:38.600
<i>But even so, it was more than enough 
to let me dream about tomorrow.</i>

13:38.600 --> 13:41.750
<i>That's how strong and warm it was.</i>

13:41.750 --> 13:43.800
Your dark, frozen heart...

13:46.300 --> 13:47.470
I'm...

13:47.900 --> 13:49.610
going to light it back up!

13:53.640 --> 13:54.580
Shy.

13:56.520 --> 13:59.980
<u> Spirit
Real Name: Pepesha Andreanova
Nationality: Russian 
 Likes: Alcohol, bread
 An airy hero who uses smoke.</u>

14:07.220 --> 14:09.510
Warm flames...

14:09.510 --> 14:13.020
Flames you just want to cozy up to forever...

14:15.960 --> 14:18.670
But I don't need them anymore.

14:19.240 --> 14:21.970
Those flames won't reach anywhere.

14:24.280 --> 14:27.070
Now that my emotions and 
memories have returned,

14:27.070 --> 14:30.820
my heart has been completed.

14:33.320 --> 14:35.710
My Amarariruku...

14:40.210 --> 14:42.770
is even bigger now!

14:49.280 --> 14:51.450
It'll continue to spread!

14:54.490 --> 14:57.190
Tzveta-chan's got wings now!

14:57.190 --> 15:00.710
Oh, crap, crap, crap, crap, crap...

15:01.160 --> 15:03.960
<i>Her powers have grown even stronger?</i>

15:03.960 --> 15:06.200
You cannot stop me.

15:14.580 --> 15:18.850
<i>It's so cold... It's almost 
enough to freeze even my lungs.</i>

15:23.060 --> 15:23.810
Oh?

15:28.440 --> 15:29.950
You're so persistent.

15:49.030 --> 15:50.330
In that case...

16:04.560 --> 16:07.200
What? What's going on?

16:12.700 --> 16:17.200
My powers have definitely gotten stronger.

16:18.080 --> 16:20.660
So why is this child...

16:37.550 --> 16:39.780
Just who are you?

16:42.640 --> 16:46.480
All I can sense from your ice is loneliness.

16:47.020 --> 16:50.980
Your sad powers can't harm me.

16:51.380 --> 16:52.870
You foolish child!

16:52.870 --> 16:55.360
You think you can understand 
my heart at all?!

16:55.830 --> 16:58.950
Of course I can, because 
I'm very familiar with it.

16:59.560 --> 17:02.200
I've seen those tears before.

17:03.580 --> 17:05.370
Those tears...

17:05.720 --> 17:09.090
are the tears you cry when you harm 
yourself for the sake of someone else.

17:10.350 --> 17:12.630
You're okay with being the only one to suffer.

17:13.720 --> 17:16.010
You're willing to sacrifice yourself...

17:17.300 --> 17:20.010
You've been ignoring how Pepesha-san 
feels this whole time.

17:21.640 --> 17:23.050
Shut your mouth!

17:25.290 --> 17:27.250
You know <i>nothing</i> about me!

17:27.250 --> 17:28.770
Don't speak as though you do!

17:29.350 --> 17:31.940
I don't care what happens to me!

17:33.100 --> 17:35.320
I don't care if no one cares about me!

17:35.660 --> 17:39.410
I'll endure any pain for 
the sake of the children!

17:44.860 --> 17:46.210
Pepesha-san!

17:47.070 --> 17:49.930
The reason Pepesha-san is here right now...

17:49.930 --> 17:52.590
is because of the love...

17:52.900 --> 17:55.340
she clearly inherited from you!

17:56.620 --> 18:00.140
The kind of love that, given 
even the smallest opportunity,

18:00.620 --> 18:03.150
she shares with others!

18:04.370 --> 18:07.140
Her kind heart that allows 
her to care for others!

18:07.650 --> 18:09.370
She inherited that from you!

18:12.600 --> 18:15.080
It's because she admired you so much

18:15.080 --> 18:17.570
that she became a world-saving hero!

18:17.970 --> 18:19.820
That can't be.

18:20.160 --> 18:24.010
I couldn't do anything for Pesha.

18:25.730 --> 18:28.050
That's why I'm here right now...

18:28.050 --> 18:31.960
So that no more failures 
like myself are born!

18:32.370 --> 18:34.390
You're just scared.

18:34.970 --> 18:37.910
You keep saying that you don't 
care what happens to you...

18:39.140 --> 18:42.260
But no person is okay with not being loved!

18:42.980 --> 18:43.980
You're...

18:43.980 --> 18:46.830
I don't need any of that!

18:56.200 --> 18:57.690
<i>Teru-chan...</i>

18:58.300 --> 18:59.900
<i>Why are you so...</i>

19:02.300 --> 19:03.610
Spirit.

19:18.070 --> 19:19.140
It'll be okay.

19:19.770 --> 19:20.760
I promise.

19:22.020 --> 19:24.010
So please, tell her properly.

19:24.580 --> 19:27.610
Actually use your words.

19:28.640 --> 19:30.520
I'll help take on some of the pain.

19:32.070 --> 19:35.770
So please... Tell her how you really feel.

19:38.250 --> 19:40.280
I won't let you get in the way!

19:46.120 --> 19:48.620
This is all for my ideals!

19:50.820 --> 19:55.060
<i>Watching Teru-chan reminds me of my old self.</i>

19:55.950 --> 19:58.340
For the children!

20:02.290 --> 20:04.340
<i>That's why I could never leave her alone,</i>

20:04.900 --> 20:07.800
<i>and always intended to give 
her the push that she needed.</i>

20:08.670 --> 20:11.600
<i>But... But you're actually...</i>

20:34.270 --> 20:36.250
I couldn't build up the courage.

20:37.330 --> 20:39.750
I was too scared of hurting you, Mama.

20:40.700 --> 20:43.130
Scared you might end up hating me.

20:43.690 --> 20:45.070
But back then...

20:46.240 --> 20:48.380
I should've told you how I really felt.

20:52.560 --> 20:56.610
Say, Mama... This is embarrassing 
and really hard to say...

20:58.190 --> 20:59.730
But will you do this with me?

21:07.560 --> 21:09.660
My first ever...

21:09.660 --> 21:11.670
all-out fight between 
mother and daughter!

22:47.050 --> 22:48.300
<b>Extra</b>

22:50.090 --> 22:51.090
<b>Blinkity</b>

22:51.180 --> 22:55.100
<b>You're so much
 cuter without
 your hood, 
Tzveta-chan!</b>

22:53.600 --> 22:55.100
<b>Really? 
Thanks.</b>

22:54.390 --> 22:55.100
<b>You're too close...</b>

22:55.600 --> 22:57.480
<b>What about you, 
Kufufu-san?</b>

22:57.890 --> 22:59.100
<b>You're so...</b>

23:00.230 --> 23:05.110
<b>Staaaaare</b>

23:05.360 --> 23:07.860
<b>You're so rowdy,
with or wihthout it.</b>

23:07.860 --> 23:10.780
<b>I got a 
compliment!</b>

23:08.860 --> 23:10.490
<b>That wasn't
 a compliment.</b>

23:14.410 --> 23:21.120
<b>Whenever, 
wherever 
we are, doot 
do do doo.</b>

23:14.910 --> 23:21.120
<b>Whoosh...</b>

23:17.580 --> 23:21.120
<b>Poik</b>

23:17.620 --> 23:21.120
<b>We feel like 
we're at Yosamite 
Heaven's Gate.</b>

23:19.330 --> 23:21.120
<b>Poik</b>

23:21.120 --> 23:26.420
<b>Don't worry 
about 
tomorrow...</b>

23:23.250 --> 23:26.420
<b>We're 
still 
useless!</b>

23:26.420 --> 23:32.180
<b>Kufufu...</b>

23:29.470 --> 23:32.180
<b>Kufufu...</b>

23:29.470 --> 23:32.180
<b>Kufufufuuu</b>

23:30.880 --> 23:32.180
<b>Gather...</b>

23:30.970 --> 23:32.180
<b>Gather...</b>

23:32.430 --> 23:36.180
<b>The end!</b>

23:33.680 --> 23:36.220
<b>That was
 a lovely 
song.</b>

23:34.220 --> 23:36.310
<b>Clap Clap</b>
